From d6a00a80db479e1a1eb15b6047c793be7804ad71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nmbath <mark@baggywrinkle.co.uk>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 10:31:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Append -containers suffix to the printed startup version

Build-specific packaging concern for the venus-containers image, not an upstream venus-platform feature - applied as a venus recipe patch (matching DISTRO_VERSION .= "-containers~2" in venus.conf and the same suffix applied to gui-v2 applicationVersion()) rather than a commit on victronenergy/venus-platform.

Only the startup log line in main.cpp - this string is not exposed via D-Bus/GUI, just printed to stdout at daemon start (daemontools log), unlike gui-v2 which has a proper Settings/About display.
---
 src/main.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/main.cpp b/src/main.cpp
index 83920f6..1b10294 100644
--- a/src/main.cpp
+++ b/src/main.cpp
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 #include <iostream>
 #include <src/application.hpp>
 
-static const char *version = "2.48";
+static const char *version = "2.48-containers";
 
 int main(int argc, char *argv[])
 {
-- 
2.43.0

